	<li id="menu-item-1633" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/stamford/">UConn Stamford Housing</a></li>	<li id="menu-item-4122" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page"><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/hartford/">UConn Hartford Housing</a></li><!--.dropdown-->
</ul>
