	<div id="content" class="site-content">
		<div class="container"><div id="page-blank">
							<div class="row">
				<div class="col-sm-12">
                						<article id="post-21" class="clearfix post-21 page type-page status-publish hentry">
	<div class="entry-content">
		<div id="pl-21"  class="panel-layout" ><div id="pg-21-0"  class="panel-grid panel-has-style" ><div class="siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-21-0" data-stretch-type="full-width-stretch" ><div id="pgc-21-0-0"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-0-0-0" class="so-panel widget widget_metaslider_widget panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="0" ><div class="panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-21-0-0-0" ><div id="metaslider-id-107" style="width: 100%;" class="ml-slider-3-112-0 ml-slider-pro-2-58-0 metaslider metaslider-flex metaslider-107 ml-slider has-dots-nav ms-theme-default" role="region" aria-label="Homepage Slideshow" data-height="600" data-width="1920">
    <div id="metaslider_container_107">
        <div id="metaslider_107">
            <ul aria-live='off' class='slides'>
                <li style="display: block; width: 100%;" class="slide-2585 ms-image " aria-roledescription="slide" data-date="2023-01-12 10:52:51" data-filename="home-slides-1920x600_0006_south-210617b0022.jpg" data-slide-type="image"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/01/home-slides-1920x600_0006_south-210617b0022.jpg" height="600" width="1920" alt="Rome" class="slider-107 slide-2585 msDefaultImage" title="home-slides-1920x600_0006_south-210617b0022" /></li>
                <li style="display: none; width: 100%;" class="slide-2588 ms-image " aria-roledescription="slide" data-date="2023-01-12 10:52:51" data-filename="home-slides-1920x600_0004_stem170302b021-1.jpg" data-slide-type="image"><img decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/01/home-slides-1920x600_0004_stem170302b021-1.jpg" height="600" width="1920" alt="Werth Lounge" class="slider-107 slide-2588 msDefaultImage" title="home-slides-1920x600_0004_stem170302b021-1" /><div class="caption-wrap"><div class="caption"><p style="font-size:2vw;color:#FFFFFF;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.15em;margin:0.67em 0;">Community</p> <p>Develop life-long relationships with students from around the world and be a part of the growing and changing Husky Nation.</p></div></div></li>
                <li style="display: none; width: 100%;" class="slide-2584 ms-image " aria-roledescription="slide" data-date="2023-01-12 10:52:51" data-filename="home-slides-1920x600_0003_NextGen160827c141-1.jpg" data-slide-type="image"><img decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/01/home-slides-1920x600_0003_NextGen160827c141-1.jpg" height="600" width="1920" alt="Werth at Night" class="slider-107 slide-2584 msDefaultImage" title="home-slides-1920x600_0003_NextGen160827c141-1" /><div class="caption-wrap"><div class="caption"><p style="font-size:2vw;color:#FFFFFF;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.15em;margin:0.67em 0;">Support</p> <p>Each residence hall has a Residence Hall Director and Resident Assistants  that help challenge, support, and guide students through the academic year</p></div></div></li>
                <li style="display: none; width: 100%;" class="slide-2587 ms-image " aria-roledescription="slide" data-date="2023-01-12 10:52:51" data-filename="home-slides-1920x600_0001_NextGen160711a050-1.jpg" data-slide-type="image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/01/home-slides-1920x600_0001_NextGen160711a050-1.jpg" height="600" width="1920" alt="Werth Tower" class="slider-107 slide-2587 msDefaultImage" title="home-slides-1920x600_0001_NextGen160711a050-1" /><div class="caption-wrap"><div class="caption"><p style="font-size:2vw;color:#FFFFFF;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.15em;margin:0.67em 0;">Convenience</p> <p>When you live at UConn Storrs, you are central to everything you need on campus. Get to class within minutes with your close proximity to academic buildings!</p></div></div></li>
                <li style="display: none; width: 100%;" class="slide-2586 ms-image " aria-roledescription="slide" data-date="2023-01-12 10:52:51" data-filename="home-slides-1920x600_0000s_0003_AerialTowers_210809a034-1.jpg" data-slide-type="image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/01/home-slides-1920x600_0000s_0003_AerialTowers_210809a034-1.jpg" height="600" width="1920" alt="Towers Quad" class="slider-107 slide-2586 msDefaultImage" title="home-slides-1920x600_0000s_0003_AerialTowers_210809a034-1" /><div class="caption-wrap"><div class="caption"><p style="font-size:2vw;color:#FFFFFF;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.15em;margin:0.67em 0;">Hall Associations</p> <p>Each area has their own organization and residents can join by running for a position on the Executive Board or attending general body meetings.</p> <div><a href="https://rha.uconn.edu/">rha.uconn.edu &gt;</a></div></div></div></li>
                <li style="display: none; width: 100%;" class="slide-2583 ms-image " aria-roledescription="slide" data-date="2023-01-12 10:52:47" data-filename="home-slides-1920x600_0008_stam-residence-hall171018c099.jpg" data-slide-type="image"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/01/home-slides-1920x600_0008_stam-residence-hall171018c099.jpg" height="600" width="1920" alt="900 Washington Building at Night" class="slider-107 slide-2583 msDefaultImage" title="home slides 1920x600_0008_stam-residence-hall171018c099" /></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        
    </div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="pg-21-1"  class="panel-grid panel-has-style" ><div class="siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-21-1" data-stretch-type="full-width-stretch" ><div id="pgc-21-1-0"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-1-0-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="1" ><div class="textwidget"><h2 style="text-align: center;font-size:2.25em"><strong>Live On and Learn at the University of Connecticut</strong></h2>
<p class="lead" style="text-align: center;">Living on campus at UConn places you right into the center of student success.<br />
Whether you are getting to class, seeking resources and support, or  looking to make new friends, you will find that living on campus is a great step towards to accomplishing your college goals.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div id="pg-21-2"  class="panel-grid panel-has-style" ><div class="box-row siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-21-2" data-stretch-type="full" ><div id="pgc-21-2-0"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-2-0-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="2" ><div class="textwidget"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/02/card-living-on.png" alt="students in dorm room" class="aligncenter wp-image-2724 size-full" width="400" height="260" /></p>
<h3>Live On Campus</h3>
<p>Room Rates, Housing Contract, Housing Selection, Changing Housing</p>
<p><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/manage-housing/room-rates/" class="btn btn-primary" rel="">Live On Campus</a></p>
</div></div></div><div id="pgc-21-2-1"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-2-1-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="3" ><div class="textwidget"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/02/card-housing.png" alt="students on campus" class="aligncenter wp-image-2723 size-full" width="400" height="260" /></p>
<h3>Housing Options</h3>
<p>Apartments, Suites, Traditional Housing, Specialty Housing</p>
<p><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/living-on-campus/housing-options/" class="btn btn-primary" rel="">View All<br /> Housing</a></p>
</div></div></div><div id="pgc-21-2-2"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-2-2-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="4" ><div class="textwidget"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/02/card-resources.png" alt="student doing laundry" class="aligncenter wp-image-2722 size-full" width="400" height="260" /></p>
<h3>Resident Resources</h3>
<p>Keys, Card Access, Mail Delivery, Repair Services, and more ...</p>
<p><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/keys-and-card-access/" class="btn btn-primary" rel="">Resident<br /> Resources</a></p>
</div></div></div><div id="pgc-21-2-3"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-2-3-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="5" ><div class="textwidget"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://campushousing.media.uconn.edu/wp-content/uploads/sites/3384/2023/02/card-parents.png" alt="student and parent" class="aligncenter wp-image-2721 size-full" width="400" height="260" /></p>
<h3>Parent &amp; Families</h3>
<p>FERPA Information, Helpful Resources, FAQs</p>
<p><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/frequently-asked-questions/#parents-families" class="btn btn-primary" rel="">Parent &amp;<br />
Family Info</a></p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div id="pg-21-3"  class="panel-grid panel-has-style" ><div class="panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-21-3" ><div id="pgc-21-3-0"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-3-0-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="6" ><div class="panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-21-3-0-0" ><div class="textwidget"><h2>Important Dates</h2>
<p>Check our full list of <strong>Important Dates</strong> for information about the Fall 2026 semester.</p>
<p><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/living-on-campus/important-dates/" class="btn btn-primary btn-block"><strong>Important Dates »</strong></a></p>
</div></div></div></div><div id="pgc-21-3-1"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-3-1-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="7" ><div class="textwidget"><h2>Log Ins</h2>
<p>Access your accounts and manage UConn Housing when you log in.</p>
<p><a href="https://campushousing.uconn.edu/myhousing/" class="btn btn-sm btn-info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MyHousing</a></p>
<p><a href="https://uconn.mycollegeroomie.app/" class="btn btn-sm btn-info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">My College Roomie</a></p>
<p><a href="https://roompact.com/login" class="btn btn-sm btn-info" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Roompact</a></p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div id="pg-21-4"  class="panel-grid panel-has-style" ><div class="siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-21-4" data-stretch-type="full" ><div id="pgc-21-4-0"  class="panel-grid-cell" ><div id="panel-21-4-0-0" class="so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child panel-last-child" data-index="8" ><div class="textwidget"><p>
