					<p class="sbi_hover_caption_wrap"
		>
		<span
			class="sbi_caption">🤔 Thinking about living at The Oaks through UConn Campus Housing for the 2026-2027 academic year?<br><br>📣 Join us tomorrow, Wednesday, March 25th from 1pm-4pm at The Oaks on the Square for our Open House!<br><br>🏠 We will be hosting apartment tours and answering questions! Refreshments will be available as well! We hope to see you there!</span>
	</p>

